{
  "id": "KeywordVolumeCpc01",
  "name": "Get Google search volume and CPC for a keyword list from Keyword Planner data using Apify",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Get Google search volume and CPC for a keyword list\n\n**Setup (3 minutes)**\n1. Open **Config** and paste your Apify API token.\n2. Paste your keywords into `keywordsText`, one per line (or comma-separated). Set `country` and `language`.\n3. Click **Test workflow**.\n\n**What you get:** one row per keyword with Google Ads Keyword Planner figures through a licensed provider: average monthly searches, competition, top-of-page bid range, 12-month trend direction, and CPC wherever Google publishes one. No modelled numbers. Keywords Google has no data for come back uncharged.\n\n**Mode:** `metrics-only` prices the keywords you give it. `ideas` expands each into new keyword ideas with the same metrics. `both` does both.\n\n**Cost:** steadyfetch/keyword-search-volume-scraper, from $2 per 1,000 keywords on Apify's Business plan ($8 on the free plan). No minimum batch. 50 keywords cost about $0.40 on the free plan.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "When clicking 'Test workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-token",
              "name": "apifyToken",
              "value": "PASTE_YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-kw",
              "name": "keywordsText",
              "value": "crm software\nemail marketing tool\nproject management app\nbest accounting software",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-country",
              "name": "country",
              "value": "US",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-lang",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "en",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-mode",
              "name": "mode",
              "value": "metrics-only",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/steadyfetch~keyword-search-volume-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?token={{ $('Config').first().json.apifyToken }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ keywords: String($('Config').first().json.keywordsText).split(/\\r?\\n|,/).map(k => k.trim()).filter(Boolean), country: $('Config').first().json.country, language: $('Config').first().json.language, mode: $('Config').first().json.mode }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Look up volume and CPC",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000094",
              "leftValue": "={{ typeof $json.keyword === 'string' && $json.keyword.length > 0 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Keyword rows only (skip the run summary)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f-kw",
              "name": "keyword",
              "value": "={{ $json.keyword }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-seed",
              "name": "seed",
              "value": "={{ $json.seed }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-vol",
              "name": "avg_monthly_searches",
              "value": "={{ $json.avgMonthlySearches }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-cpc",
              "name": "cpc_usd",
              "value": "={{ $json.cpcUsd }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-comp",
              "name": "competition",
              "value": "={{ $json.competition }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-low",
              "name": "low_top_of_page_bid_usd",
              "value": "={{ $json.lowTopOfPageBidUsd }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-high",
              "name": "high_top_of_page_bid_usd",
              "value": "={{ $json.highTopOfPageBidUsd }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-trend",
              "name": "trend",
              "value": "={{ $json.trendDirection }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-asof",
              "name": "data_as_of",
              "value": "={{ $json.dataAsOf }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "f-charged",
              "name": "charged",
              "value": "={{ $json.charged }}",
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9b2e0002-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Tidy fields (pipe to Sheets from here)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        -80
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
